# core.autocrlf is true on the founder's machine, and git was about to run a
# binary PDF through line-ending normalisation. A mangled PDF is a PDF that
# will not open, and nothing would have said so until someone tried.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# The site is served byte-for-byte by Netlify; keep it LF everywhere.
*.html text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
